      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3615@58/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3615@58/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I'm a big supporter of domestic oil production. One thing we can definitely do is begin to drill in Alaska.",
    "zh": "我是国内石油生产的大力支持者。我们绝对可以做的一件事就是开始钻研阿拉斯加州。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3616@52/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3616@57/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3616@59/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3616@59/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3616@59/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The crisis resulted from a regional war against Israel. We need to work towards lasting peace agreements to prevent this in the future.",
    "zh": "这场危机是针对以色列的地区战争造成的。我们需要努力达成持久和平协议，以防止未来再次发生这种情况。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3617@53/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3617@58/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3617@60/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3617@60/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3617@60/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to do anything we can, including reducing our consumption, working for peace deals, producing domestically, and stabilizing our relationships with oil-producing allies.",
    "zh": "我们需要尽一切努力，包括减少消费、争取和平协议、国内生产以及稳定与产油盟友的关系。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3618@54/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3618@59/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3618@61/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3618@61/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3618@61/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I am a strong supporter of labor unions and I would support this type of measure.",
    "zh": "我是工会的坚定支持者，我会支持此类措施。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3626@55/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3626@66/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3626@64/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3626@60/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3626@63/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This isn't an issue that I have strong feelings about, one way or the other. I think it is the kind of thing that each state can figure out for themselves.",
    "zh": "不管怎样，这不是一个我有强烈感受的问题。我认为这是每个州都可以自己解决的问题。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3627@56/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3627@67/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3627@65/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3627@61/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3627@64/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I go more the other way on this issue. I think that more states should be right-to-work. Unions dangerously distort the economy and the political process.",
    "zh": "在这个问题上我更多地采取了另一种方式。我认为应该有更多的州工作权。工会危险地扭曲了经济和政治进程。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3628@57/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3628@68/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3628@66/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3628@62/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3628@65/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe we should implement an immediate moratorium on the testing of nuclear devices.",
    "zh": "我认为我们应该立即暂停核装置试验。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3629@58/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3629@66/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3629@63/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3629@66/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This is an issue I'd have to consider carefully, but perhaps if we got the Soviet Union on board I'd be open to it.",
    "zh": "这是一个我必须仔细考虑的问题，但也许如果我们让苏联加入，我会对此持开放态度。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3630@59/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3630@67/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3630@64/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3630@67/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I don't believe so. Our nation's security depends on being adequately prepared to face Soviet aggression.",
    "zh": "我不这么认为。我们国家的安全取决于是否做好充分准备应对苏联的侵略。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3631@60/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3631@68/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3631@65/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3631@68/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I don't really care too much one way or the other. As long as we have sufficient supplies in the U.S., we should ship grain to whoever will pay for it.",
    "zh": "我并不太关心其中一种方式。只要美国有足够的供应，我们就应该把粮食运送给谁付钱。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3632@61/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3632@69/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3632@64/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3632@67/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3632@66/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This policy is a win-win for us. It helps our own farmers prosper, and it is a public relations victory for the world to see the Soviet Union depending on American enterprise.",
    "zh": "这项政策对我们来说是双赢的。它帮助我们自己的农民繁荣，看到苏联依赖美国企业，这对世界来说是一次公共关系的胜利。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3633@62/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3633@70/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3633@65/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3633@68/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3633@67/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This policy helps support an unsustainable Soviet system. I believe that we should never bail out communism from its failures if we're serious about winning the Cold War.",
    "zh": "这项政策有助于支持不可持续的苏联体系。我相信，如果我们真的想赢得冷战，我们就不应该将共产主义从其失败中拯救出来。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3634@63/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3634@71/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3634@66/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3634@69/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3634@68/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This is an idea that I support, and I will try my best to see it implemented.",
    "zh": "这是我支持的想法，我会尽力实现它。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3635@64/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3635@67/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3635@70/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3635@69/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3635@69/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3635@66/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This is an interesting idea, but I'm more concerned about issues like education and health care.",
    "zh": "这是一个有趣的想法，但我更关心教育和医疗保健等问题。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3636@65/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3636@68/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3636@71/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3636@70/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3636@70/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3636@67/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I think the current forms of tax exemptions and aid we have are sufficient. This would be another huge, costly, and complicated program to administer when we are trying to reduce our deficit.",
    "zh": "我认为目前我们拥有的免税和援助形式已经足够了。当我们试图减少赤字时，这将是另一个庞大、昂贵且复杂的管理计划。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3637@66/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3637@69/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3637@72/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3637@71/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3637@71/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3637@68/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This kind of idea is way off the mark. We need to focus on reducing the size of government and lowering taxes.",
    "zh": "这种想法完全不切实际。我们需要集中精力减少政府规模和降低税收。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3638@67/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3638@70/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3638@73/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3638@72/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3638@72/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3638@69/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I think the fact that this regime collapsed so fast once American troops were gone shows how unsound it really was. We should have never fought the Vietnam War in the first place.",
    "zh": "我认为，一旦美国军队消失，这个政权就崩溃得如此之快，这表明它确实是多么不健全。我们一开始就不应该与越南战争作战。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3639@68/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3639@72/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3639@69/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3639@74/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3639@70/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We did our best in Vietnam, but unfortunately things didn't turn out the way we wanted.",
    "zh": "我们在越南尽了最大努力，但不幸的是事情并没有按照我们想要的方式发展。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3640@69/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3640@73/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3640@70/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3640@75/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3640@71/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We were trying to provide more aid to South Vietnam, but Congress would not approve additional expenditures. The results of that policy are clear.",
    "zh": "我们试图向南越提供更多援助，但国会不会批准额外支出。该政策的结果是显而易见的。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3641@70/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3641@74/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3641@71/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3641@76/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3641@72/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We defeated ourselves throughout this war. American firepower could have knocked North Vietnam into submission if we had been more aggressive.",
    "zh": "在这场战争中我们打败了自己。如果我们更具侵略性，美国的火力可能会让北越屈服。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3642@71/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3642@75/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3642@72/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3642@77/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3642@73/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Absolutely I do. We should not tolerate high unemployment in this country, and this Act provides the tools to prevent it.",
    "zh": "我当然愿意。我们不应该容忍这个国家的高失业率，该法案提供了防止这种情况发生的工具。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3643@72/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3643@76/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3643@73/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3643@71/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3643@78/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3643@73/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3643@73/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3643@74/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I'm all for some programs to provide jobs, but this Act has too many mandates and goals that are inconsistent with each other. We can't have a balanced budget, full employment, and low inflation at the same time.",
    "zh": "我完全支持一些提供就业机会的计划，但该法案有太多相互不一致的任务和目标。我们不可能同时拥有平衡预算、充分就业和低通胀。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3644@73/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3644@77/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3644@74/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3644@72/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3644@79/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3644@74/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3644@74/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3644@75/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I can see both sides of this issue, but if Congress passes this Act I won't veto it as President.",
    "zh": "我可以看到这个问题的两面，但如果国会通过这项法案，我不会作为总统否决它。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3645@74/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3645@78/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3645@75/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3645@73/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3645@80/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3645@75/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3645@75/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3645@76/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This Act has no basis in economic reality. If we could wave a magic wand and ensure 3% unemployment and 0% inflation with a balanced budget and no trade deficit, do you think we wouldn't have done it already?",
    "zh": "该法案没有经济现实基础。如果我们能够挥舞魔杖，确保 3% 的失业率和 0% 的通胀率，同时预算平衡且没有贸易赤字，你认为我们不会这么做吗？",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3646@75/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3646@79/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3646@76/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3646@74/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3646@81/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3646@76/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3646@76/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3646@77/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I would absolutely support a law like this as President. It is past time that our nation had health coverage for all.",
    "zh": "作为总统，我绝对会支持这样的法律。我们国家为所有人提供医疗保险的时代已经过去了。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3647@76/description",
