      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3647@77/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3647@75/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3647@82/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3647@77/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3647@77/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3647@78/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "It would depend on things like how the law worked, and how we would pay for it. But I'm not opposed to it in theory.",
    "zh": "这取决于法律如何运作以及我们如何支付费用等因素。但理论上我并不反对。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3648@77/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3648@81/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3648@78/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3648@76/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3648@83/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3648@78/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3648@78/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3648@79/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I think it is a noble goal, but it would add too much of a financial burden to the federal budget, which is already running a deficit.",
    "zh": "我认为这是一个崇高的目标，但它会给已经出现赤字的联邦预算增加太多的财政负担。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3649@78/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3649@82/description",
      "1976_Carter_Glenn/answers_json/3649@79/description",
      "1976_Carter_Jackson/answers_json/3649@77/description",
      "1976_Ford_Dole/answers_json/3649@84/description",
      "1976_Ford_Baker/answers_json/3649@79/description",
      "1976_Ford_Anderson/answers_json/3649@79/description",
      "1976_Ford_Connally/answers_json/3649@80/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Absolutely not. Not only would this ruin the federal budget, but it would also eliminate competition and lead to substandard health care for the vast majority of Americans.",
    "zh": "绝对不是。这不仅会破坏联邦预算，还会消除竞争并导致绝大多数美国人的医疗保健不合格。",
    "keys": [
      "1976_Carter_Mondale/answers_json/3650@79/description",
      "1976_Carter_Church/answers_json/3650@83/description",
